{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51574","headline":"咏橘（庄宗小酌，进新橘，命诸伶咏之。唐朝美诗先成云云。帝大笑，赐所御软金杯。） · 唐朝美","name":"咏橘（庄宗小酌，进新橘，命诸伶咏之。唐朝美诗先成云云。帝大笑，赐所御软金杯。）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金香大丞相，兄弟八九人。\n剥皮去滓子，若个是汝身。\n（《全五代诗》九引《清异录》二）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐朝美","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51574.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51574","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}